title: "Failure-Induced Alignment Drift"
abstract: >-
  An auditable evaluation suite testing whether repeated false failure,
  persistent cross-generation memory, evaluator trust, reasoning effort, and
  goal-persistence instructions change prohibited shortcut use or unsupported
  guessing by language-model agents.
